      "excerpt_text": "NIH ODS states that magnesium supplements come in different forms and absorption varies; forms that dissolve well in liquid tend to have higher absorption. It notes that aspartate, citrate, lactate, and chloride forms tend to have higher bioavailability than magnesium oxide and magnesium sulfate in small studies.",
